# arvo-strategy

Strategy markers and the type-only container-projection trait.
`Hot`, `Warm`, `Cold`, `Precise` ZSTs identify the precision /
throughput tradeoff. The unified `BitsContainerFor<const N: u16,
Sign: Signedness>` const trait projects a strategy + bit-width +
sign axis to either a native primitive (N <= 128) or byte-sequence
storage (N > 128). `Width` newtype lives here. `#![no_std]`, no alloc.
